sequenceDiagram
  actor Citizen
  participant UI as React
  participant API as Spring Boot
  participant Auth as Security/Policy
  participant App as Application Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Outbox as Outbox Worker

  Citizen->>UI: Submit application
  UI->>API: POST /applications/{id}/submit
  API->>Auth: Authenticate + authorize ownership
  Auth-->>API: Authorized
  API->>App: submit(command)
  App->>DB: Begin transaction / load current version
  App->>App: Validate schema, fields, documents, transition
  App->>DB: Update state + task + history + audit + outbox
  DB-->>App: Commit
  App-->>API: Submission result
  API-->>UI: Reference number + status
  Outbox->>DB: Claim pending event
  Outbox->>Outbox: Publish notification event
